## Design defaults

- JetBrains Mono; lowercase UI labels; white shell; pastel `Mark` accents
- Prefer existing patterns; avoid generic AI looks (purple gradients, cream+serif, dense broadsheet)
- **Viewport chrome**: desktop (`lg+`) sticky top nav with text + `Mark`; mobile bottom tab bar uses **icons only** (same `navLinks` in `src/data/nav.ts`, icons mapped in `Layout.tsx` from `shared/nav/`). Hide mobile bar when shell overlay is open (writing editor).
- **Shell gutters**: use `src/components/shellLayout.ts` (`shellPadX` = `px-4 lg:px-10`, `max-w-6xl`). Don’t invent per-page mobile padding; full-bleed via `shellBleedX` only.
- **Heatmap**: desktop top-nav `Scan` toggle; `HeatmapOverlay` when on — keep out of mobile chrome unless asked.
- **Receipt**: desktop top-nav `Receipt` toggle → `ReceiptDock` bottom-right (flush bottom, `right-8`). Local visit stats only; hide when writing overlay is open.

## Landing (`/`) — responsive behavior

- **Desktop**: GIF + `ApiDoc` side by side (GIF may tilt; overlap ok). Assets: `src/assets/landing/`.
- **Mobile sequence** (`Landing.tsx`): GIF alone (no rotate) → one full GIF loop (~2.2s) → fade out → mount `ApiDoc` (typewriter starts after its entrance). Skip sequence when `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- **Mobile insets**: GIF `calc(100vw - 80px)` (40px sides); ApiDoc wrapper `calc(100vw - 48px)` (24px sides). Keep type readable — don’t CSS-scale the card down.

## Home

- `#intro`: copy + `PracticeMap` teaser (`lg:grid-cols-[2fr_3fr]`). Map labels: left-aligned to node, wrap ≤2 lines, ~8px below node; spheres + Mark accents; teaser cycles spotlight.
- `#creative-text`: `CreativeTextRow` — **2 columns** when stage width `< 900`, **5** on desktop. Wrap images/posters desktop-only (`≥1024`).
- `#gallery`: Phaidon-style `IndexGallery` (no orphan rows on 7-col desktop).

## Work

- `WorkCard` half-width on desktop (`lg:w-1/2`); logos + GDM wordmark from `src/assets/work/`; flow data in `workCardFlow.ts`.

## Content extension points

- **Writing** → `src/data/writing-articles/<id>.json` + `columns.json` (see writing rule)
- **Experiments** → `src/data/experiments.json` + `src/assets/experiments/videos/`
- **Home posters / flow** → `src/assets/home/posters/` (+ `shared/stills/` if shared) + `creativeFlow.ts`
- **Writing figures** → `src/assets/writing/figures/` (+ `shared/stills/` for heroes)
- **Work logos** → `src/assets/work/` + `workCardFlow.ts`
- **Practice map nodes** → `src/data/practiceMap.ts`

Do **not** hardcode new posts/experiments into page JSX. Start: `AGENTS.md`. Vision/changelog: `overview.md`.
